"linkend=\"ffmpeg\"/> (para construir <command>sherlock265</command>)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libde265.xml:83
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libde265"
msgstr "Instalação do libde265"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libde265.xml:88
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"At first, prevent the installation of some programs only useful for hacking "
"libde265:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiramente, impeça a instalação de alguns programas úteis somente para "
"hackear a libde265:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libde265.xml:92
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed '/tools/d' -i Makefile.am &amp;&amp;\n"
"./autogen.sh</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed '/tools/d' -i Makefile.am &amp;&amp;\n"
"./autogen.sh</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libde265.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libde265</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>libde265</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libde265.xml:100
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libde265.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libde265.xml:110
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libde265.xml:113
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libde265.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libde265.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-encoder</option>: This option enables the H.265 encoder, in"
" addition to the decoder.  The encoder is still experimental so the "
"instruction above does not contain this option."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-encoder</option>: Essa opção habilita o codificador H.265, "
"além do decodificador. O codificador ainda é experimental, de forma que a "
"instrução acima não contém essa opção."

